<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia YTL year net up 57.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia YTL year net up 57.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     291.80	vs	185.31</p>
<p>    Shr     (cents)	 53.9	 vs	 36.4</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,611.43	vs    1,025.40</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 356.08	vs	231.26</p>
<p>    Minorities	less  12.68	vs less  12.62</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 93.50	vs	 88.17</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)   10.0	 vs	 10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the company is YTL Corp Bhd. It is involved in power generation and infrastructure construction.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
